{"title": "Mystra's Blessing (Staff of Arcane Blessing) (Condition)", "pageid": 27977, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mystra's_Blessing_(Staff_of_Arcane_Blessing)_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bless Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Bless_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Mystra's Blessing</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>+1d4 to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a> made with spells </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_BLESS_STAFF_MYSTRA</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CUND_BLESS_STAFF_MYSTRA%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CUND_BLESS_STAFF_MYSTRA%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<p>The in-game description of this condition is incorrect, and reads as follows:\n</p>\n<blockquote style=\"font-size:130%; font-family:Georgia;\"><i> Additional 1d4 to Saving Throws and weapon attack rolls, and an additional 2d4 to spell attack rolls. </i></blockquote>\n<p>In truth, the only effect is a 1d4 bonus to spell attack rolls. The full effects listed in the description correspond to the <i>cumulative</i> effects of the regular <a href=\"/wiki/Bless_(Condition)\" title=\"Bless (Condition)\">Bless condition</a> coupled with this additional effect.\n</p><p>It's possible to lose the regular Bless condition (due to the caster losing <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">concentration</a>) while retaining Mystra's Blessing. In this case, the creature will be left with a 1d4 bonus to spell attack rolls and no other bonus.\n</p><p>See also the notes for the <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Blessing\" title=\"Mystra's Blessing\">Mystra's Blessing passive effect</a>, which is the source of this condition.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Mystra.27s_Blessing\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Mystra's_Blessing\">Sources of Mystra's Blessing</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Blessing\" title=\"Mystra's Blessing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mystra's Blessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mystra%27s_Blessing\" title=\"Mystra's Blessing\">Mystra's Blessing</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201856\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1532/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19456/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7490/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.025/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1100107/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.568      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   49.568      1 -total\n 59.05%   29.272      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 33.23%   16.470      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 18.06%    8.951      1 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 16.86%    8.357      1 Template:MdPass\n 14.28%    7.077      4 Template:Icon_text\n 14.14%    7.007      3 Template:Template_style\n 13.01%    6.450     17 Template:Trim\n 12.72%    6.304      3 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27977-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201856 and revision id 342743. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}